---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base
  title="Support the project"
  description="PQC Deps is free and non-commercial. How to support it with a donation, a correction or a share."
>
  <div class="support">
    <p class="eyebrow">Non-commercial</p>
    <h1>Free for everyone. <em>Kept going by its users.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      {SITE.name} is a free, non-commercial community project: no ads, no tracking cookies, no paid
      features, and no sponsor deciding what the data says. Everything, including the data, is open.
    </p>

    {
      SITE.donateUrl ? (
        <section class="donate card" aria-labelledby="donate-h">
          <h2 id="donate-h">Donate</h2>
          <p>
            If {SITE.name} saved you time, a small donation helps keep it running and up to date.
            One-time or monthly, any amount.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={SITE.donateUrl} rel="noopener">
            Support on Ko-fi →
          </a>
          <p class="muted small">
            Payments are handled by Ko-fi; this site never sees your payment details. {SITE.name} is
            run by an individual, not a registered charity, so donations are not tax-deductible.
          </p>
        </section>
      ) : (
        <p class="card muted">Donations will open soon.</p>
      )
    }

    <section aria-labelledby="where-h">
      <h2 id="where-h">Where the money goes</h2>
      <ul class="costs">
        <li>
          <strong>Research and review time.</strong> Every claim is checked against its source before
          it goes live; that is most of the work.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>The domain and services.</strong> Hosting and the AI quota run on free tiers today;
          donations make it possible to keep them as the catalog grows.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>More coverage.</strong> More ecosystems (PHP, Ruby, Swift) and tools like a GitHub
          Action and a command-line checker.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="other-h">
      <h2 id="other-h">Other ways to help</h2>
      <ul class="costs">
        <li>
          <strong>Correct something.</strong> Every library page has a one-click correction link.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Request a library.</strong> <a href="/request">Tell us</a> what's missing.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Add the badge</strong> to a project you maintain, or share the site with your team.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Contribute on <a href={SITE.repoUrl}>GitHub</a></strong>: data files, code and docs
          are all open.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .support {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .donate {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .donate h2 {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .donate .btn {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .donate .small {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .costs {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .costs li + li {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }
</style>
